<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Nah.</a></div>
</div>
</div>
<p>I wanted to like this until the UIU comparison. I hate this UIUseless bullshit, and I hate how by using UIUseless as the baseline of a comparison, the husband makes his wife seem weak and pitiful and a dumbass, and thus making her just a plot point to advance the story further, and advance his characterization. It's only an insinuation, sure, but it's an absolute hokey and incredibly dumb one, so downvoted.</p>

